  "description": "This Snickers-inspired smoothie blends peanut butter, dates, cocoa, toasted oats, and banana into a creamy, satisfying drink that's equally suited for breakfast, a snack, or dessert.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: 2 teaspoons light brown sugar, raw sugar, or honey (optional); 1 teaspoon cacao nibs for topping, optional; Crushed peanuts, for topping, optional\n\nOptional substitutions: quick cooking → old-fashioned rolled oats; unsweetened almond milk → your preferred milk\n\nNotes: While we prefer almond milk here for its mild, slightly nutty flavor, any milk will work well in its place, including oat, soy, coconut, or dairy milk.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: This smoothie is best enjoyed immediately after blending.",
